3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","review_id":"w2GZ41ckz_1LJzVKJ2U9jA","date":"2012-07-16T21:41:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.946287989616394,"text_excerpt":"I'm currently having a love affair with Satsuma. I went for the first time ever a few weeks ago and fell totally in love. Their menu is awesome, as is the atmosphere. The special BLT on sourdough (with goat cheese and avocado mash) is flippin' amazing. The tomato basil pesto on Ciabatta is good too. They make fresh juices, coffee, salads, you name it. The little courtyard/outdoor area is so charming, and though I haven't brought my pooches along yet, I love the fact that they're welcome here. The mismatched furniture inside adds a lot of character. And the staff has always been really really friendly. I'll be back as often as I'm in the Bywater!"},{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","review_id":"W38DpPimkmxhxstRvPbu0Q","date":"2016-04-19T21:00:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9385051131248474,"text_excerpt":"Satsuma is one of my favorite spots in the Bywater for an fresh and healthy meal. Not only is the food healthy and delicious, but the vibe is quite cool. There's everything from veggie juices, to breakfast, to sandwiches. I tried the tofu crumble this morning and it was delicious! It definitely is one of my favorite tofu-egg-substitutes that I've tried thus far! Vegetarians rejoice and rub your belly at this delicious veggie friendly spot! The only down side I would say is that food is a tad bit pricey, but so is anywhere you go with this type of menu. Overall, price is somewhat average, food is tasty, atmosphere is cool. Def somewhere to check out!"},{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","review_id":"HK91_eDM4qljfal-PY-_nA","date":"2016-04-16T21:34:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9358644485473633,"text_excerpt":"Satsuma is awesome! Everything in here is fresh, colorful and flavorful. I brought my 13 year old daughter hoping she might welcome the change from pizza and burgers...she did. Yay! Very diverse menu. The place is very artsy and fun with a super relaxed vibe. The staff is very friendly and helpful. I had a green juice (wonderful selection of juices)and the Satsuma Cuban. It was also delicious-so tender and the ciabatta bread was perfect! My daughter got the grilled cheddar cheese and a fresh mint tea-also very good. She managed to find a vegan chocolate cookie and a couple of cupcakes...also great! I want to go back to have breakfast very soon. I love this place! Another beautiful spot in..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","photo_id":"3ChCVx_wgSxQsWnLY1M6RQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3ChCVx_wgSxQsWnLY1M6RQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9278083443641663},{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","photo_id":"dm1iGyscQ4ymxZowxLRzuA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dm1iGyscQ4ymxZowxLRzuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.927323579788208},{"business_id":"ZgmEBmGQbSHj8YZgN2pPLQ","photo_id":"5I_1D_fJ5r_5yOTf5-Jj5g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5I_1D_fJ5r_5yOTf5-Jj5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8902695775032043}]},"notebook_case":null}
